      "lines": [
        "$=1.2\\cdot(-6)$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为$(-4.5)\\cdot(-2)=9$，$(-2)\\cdot(-4.5)=9$，所以$(-4.5)↵\\cdot(-2)=(-2)\\cdot(-4.5)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当一个或两个因数等于零时，乘法交换律仍然成立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "正负数乘法也满足结合律："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "对于任意数$a,b$和$c$，等式$(ab)c=a(bc)$成立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们设$a=-3,b=-5,c=6$，来验证等式$(ab)c=a(bc)$.",
        "因为$-3\\cdot(-5)=15$，$15\\cdot6=90$，所以$(ab)c=90$；因为$-5\\cdot6↵=-30$，而$(-3)\\cdot(-30)=90$，所以$a(bc)$也等于90."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当几个因数甚至全部因数等于零时，结合律仍然成立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "540",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "计算：",
        "1) $(-2)\\cdot(-50)\\cdot6\\cdot12$；2) $11\\cdot(-4)\\cdot(-7)\\cdot25$；",
        "3) $(-6)\\cdot8\\cdot(-2)\\cdot(-5)$；",
        "4) $(-3)\\cdot(-125)\\cdot8\\cdot(-3)$；",
        "5) $(-3)\\cdot(-3)\\cdot(-3)\\cdot(-3)$；",
        "6) $(-6)\\cdot(-6)\\cdot6\\cdot(-6)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "541",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "化简下列各式：",
        "1) $(-8.3)\\cdot10x$；2) $4\\cdot(-6.5)\\cdot m$；",
        "3) $x\\cdot(-5)\\cdot1.2$；4) $(-3.2)\\cdot a\\cdot(-3)$；",
        "5) $(-3)\\cdot(a-b)\\cdot2.1$；6) $(-9)\\cdot(-1.1)\\cdot(m+n)$；",
        "7) $4m\\cdot(a+b)\\cdot(-20)$；",
        "8) $(-6)\\cdot a\\cdot(-5)\\cdot(a-b)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "542",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下列各种数连乘，得正数还是负数？",
        "1) 1个负数和2个正数；"
      ]
    },
